enture\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A team of ageing mercenaries are hired by a wealthy industrialist for one final mission: Recruit and train a squad of desperate commandos, parachute into an unstable African nation, snatch its deposed President from a maximum-security prison, escape via the military-controlled airport and massacre anyone who gets in their way.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Reaching the target will be murder, but getting out alive may be impossible.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong violence, injury detail, language, drug misuse<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763167424TheWildGeese.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763167423Wild.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-wild-geese\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-25\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=qFzd_fJx36I\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"qFzd_fJx36I\",\"duration\":\"2h 34m\",\"movie_year\":\"1978\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Richard Burton\"},{\"actor\":\"Roger Moore\"},{\"actor\":\"Richard Harris\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Andrew V. McLaglen\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show