till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-26 07:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-31 01:07:26\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-26\"},{\"movie_id\":\"727\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Choral\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Historical period drama\"},{\"name\":\"Music\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. The Choral&rsquo;s ambitious committee, determined to press ahead, decides to recruit local young males to swell their ranks. They must also engage a new chorus master, and despite their suspicions that he has something to hide, their best bet seems to be Dr. Henry Guthrie - driven, uncompromising, and recently returned from a career in Germany. As conscription papers start to arrive, the whole community discovers that the best response to the chaos that is laying waste to their lives is to make music together.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Directed by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner NICHOLAS HYTNER (The Crucible) and written by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner ALAN BENNETT, The Choral marks their fourth writer-director collaboration following the acclaimed films The Madness of King George, The History Boys, and The Lady in The Van.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Infrequent strong language, moderate sex<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/6H9Rr0RTmcBBKXBcttsD0aw0jG8.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/tIy0gADLtWQ7V3lcZtLyiyXBUb5.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-choral\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=EYMIhLwiHVs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"EYMIhLwiHVs\",\"duration\":\"2h 13m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ralph Fiennes\"},{\"actor\":\"Emily Fairn\"},{\"actor\":\"Mark Addy\"},{\"actor\":\"Roger Allam\"},{\"actor\":\"Simon Russell Beale\"},{\"actor\":\"Thomas Howes\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Nicholas Hytner\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9136\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"eTNTYXNTdlRrYjk5d29uMndIMmQzdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1764151200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-26 10:00am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-18 01:53:57\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"},{\"show_time_id\":\"9097\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dlVMdlFLVjlCSlBqUzJUVVM3bFlJQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 2\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.30\",\"time_sorting\":1764167400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-26 02:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-18 01:03:52\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-26\"},{\"movie_id\":\"825\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"A Paw Patrol Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"Canada\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>When Santa comes down with a sickness, Rubble steps up to rescue the holiday spirit while racing against Mayor Humdinger's sneaky plan to swipe everyone's gifts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Very mild threat<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762736811A_Paw_Patrol_Christmas_1-Sheet.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762736811A_Paw_Patrol_Christmas_Quad.webp\",\"url_key\":\"a-paw-patrol-christmas-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=HYi1EDnpy9M\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"HYi1EDnpy9M\",\"duration\":\"1h 28m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9138\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dlcwb0g1YWMwMXZsb3BOUC9mWU05UT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 3\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:10am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.10\",\"time_sorting\":1764151800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-26 10:10am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-18 01:54:49\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"},{\"show_time_id\":\"9137\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"bGQ1dy82SHpSc0lBYVYzOVNKRHdidz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.30\",\"time_sorting\":1764160200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-26 12:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-18 01:54:08\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-26\"},{\"movie_id\":\"846\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Christmas Karma\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA, UK\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>From the director of Bend It Like Beckham and Bride & Prejudice, Gurinder Chadha, comes a vibrant, feel-good musical reimagining of A Christmas Carol for today&rsquo;s world. Kunal Nayyar stars as modern-day Scrooge Mr. Sood, whose encounter with three Ghosts of Christmas - played by Eva Longoria, Billy Porter and Boy George - helps him rediscover the true spirit of kindness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With a star-studded cast and an eclectic soundtrack blending gospel, bhangra, rap, carols and pop, Christmas Karma is a joyful celebration of compassion, community and modern British life.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mild violence, discrimination, language<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/vTfG7WbIABYAi1cpGtw0FWaBNMw.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/zadF0YmMZGpjmn0T2is90YjddMX.webp\",\"url_key\":\"christmas-karma-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=yGGC5YCTNaQ\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"yGGC5YCTNaQ\",\"duration\":\"2h 14m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Kunal Nayyar\"},{\"actor\":\"Hugh Bonneville\"},{\"actor\":\"Danny Dyer\"},{\"actor\":\"Boy George\"},{\"actor\":\"Pixie Lott\"},{\"actor\":\"Tracy-Ann Oberman\"},{\"actor\":\"Shaznay Lewis\"},{\"actor\":\"Eva Longoria\"},{\"actor\":\"Priyanka Chopra\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Gurinder Chadha\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9152\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"d3AxdlFQVDlGRkxaMHZMcGtXWmJzdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_