            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"824\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Left-Handed Girl\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"Taiwan\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A single mother and her two daughters return to Taipei after several years of living in the countryside to open a stand at a buzzing night market. Each in their way will have to adapt to this new environment to make ends meet and maintain the family unity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>But when their traditional grandfather forbids his youngest left-handed granddaughter from using her \\\"devil hand,\\\" generations of family secrets begin to unravel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong language, sex<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/pXlEThtgrTVtQEw1HQ9Qp8I1A3e.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hM2BQsAozxap3vQgQUQfCtNg2nk.webp\",\"url_key\":\"left-handed-girl-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=0rXnpfzpk8s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"0rXnpfzpk8s\",\"duration\":\"2h 8m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Nina Ye\"},{\"actor\":\"Janel Tsai\"},{\"actor\":\"Shih-Yuan Ma\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Shih-Ching Tsou\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[{\"id\":\"8\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"short_name\":\"Eng Sub\",\"description\":null},{\"id\":\"11\",\"name\":\"Mandarin\",\"short_name\":\"Mand\",\"description\":null}],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":