ke music together.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Directed by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner NICHOLAS HYTNER (The Crucible) and written by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner ALAN BENNETT, The Choral marks their fourth writer-director collaboration following the acclaimed films The Madness of King George, The History Boys, and The Lady in The Van.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Infrequent strong language, moderate sex<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/6H9Rr0RTmcBBKXBcttsD0aw0jG8.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/tIy0gADLtWQ7V3lcZtLyiyXBUb5.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-choral\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=EYMIhLwiHVs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"EYMIhLwiHVs\",\"duration\":\"2h 13m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ralph Fiennes\"},{\"actor\":\"Emily Fairn\"},{\"actor\":\"Mark Addy\"},{\"actor\":\"Roger Allam\"},{\"actor\":\"Simon Russell Beale\"},{\"actor\":\"Thomas Howes\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Nicholas Hytner\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9133\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RkgrVlpzbW9MZ0pqaFZQTjEycGtMdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\