l Preview screening\",\"short_name\":\"Preview\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-27 08:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-05 01:31:15\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-27\"},{\"movie_id\":\"846\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Christmas Karma\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA, UK\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>From the director of Bend It Like Beckham and Bride & Prejudice, Gurinder Chadha, comes a vibrant, feel-good musical reimagining of A Christmas Carol for today&rsquo;s world. Kunal Nayyar stars as modern-day Scrooge Mr. Sood, whose encounter with three Ghosts of Christmas - played by Eva Longoria, Billy Porter and Boy George - helps him rediscover the true spirit of kindness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With a star-studded cast and an eclectic soundtrack blending gospel, bhangra, rap, carols and pop, Christmas Karma is a joyful celebration of compassion, community and modern British life.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mild violence, discrimination, language<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/vTfG7WbIABYAi1cpGtw0FWaBNMw.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/zadF0YmMZGpjmn0T2is90YjddMX.webp\",\"url_key\":\"christmas-karma-2025\",\"session_start_da