2 02:12:33\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-27\"},{\"movie_id\":\"729\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Die My Love\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, Canada, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>From renowned filmmaker Lynne Ramsay, DIE MY LOVE is a visceral and uncompromising portrait of a woman engulfed by love and madness. Anchored by a ferocious, tour-de-force performance from Jennifer Lawrence, and co-starring Robert Pattinson.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A hopeful young couple, Grace and Jackson, move from New York to a house in the country. Grace tries to find her Identity with a new baby in this environment. Yet as she begins to unravel, it&rsquo;s not in weakness but imagination, strength and a stunning vivacity that she discovers herself anew.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mental health theme, strong sex, nudity, language<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/mgsTwamYMfNZTyTtdE3EjahqYlc.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hd3fGmC8aHRP8QFVbmswCtPXdwT.webp\",\"url_key\":\"die-my-love-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=LsUgd9DnVY0\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"LsUgd9DnVY0\",\"duration\":\"2h 18m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jennifer Lawrence\"},{\"actor\":\"Robert Pattinson\"},{\"actor\":\"Sissy Spacek\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Lynne Ramsay\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9132\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"ZFpEY2h1dWF2WUlkS1creWMxR3FPZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"show_time_slots\":\"5:40pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"17.40\",\"time_sorting\":1764265200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-27 05:40pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-18 01:49:24\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-27\"},{\"movie_id\":\"844\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Art Class + Drink + Film: Festive Edition\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Art + Drinks: Festive Edition at Lumiere Cinema<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get festive with a cosy series of creative Christmas evenings at Lumiere Cinema! Each session includes a fun art workshop, a seasonal drink (prosecco, beer, or mocktail) and a screening of a mystery Christmas film.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Led by local artists from <em>Well Social CIC<\\/em>, every workshop is different, from printing, mindful painting, to portraits and expression. Come with friends, family, or solo and enjoy a relaxed, creative evening.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your ticket includes all materials, a festive beverage, and entry to the film. Perfect for getting into the holiday spirit and making something special to take home!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Upcoming workshops include:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Gelli Plate Printing &ndash; Create Your Own Christmas Cards<\\/strong> <br \\/> <em>Thursday 27th November 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on and discover the magic of Gelli plate printing in this festive art workshop! You&rsquo;ll learn how to create beautiful, layered prints using vibrant inks, stencils, and textures - perfect for turning into your own unique Christmas cards or gift tags. No experience needed - just a love of colour, creativity, and Christmas spirit. All materials provided, and you&rsquo;ll leave with a bundle of handmade cards ready to send to family and friends.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Portrait Painting &ndash; Paint Each Other or Bring a Photo<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 4th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Unleash your inner artist in this relaxed portrait painting session, where you can paint each other or bring a photo of someone special to capture in your own unique style. Guided by an artist, you&rsquo;ll explore colour, expression, and technique in a fun, social setting - no pressure, just creativity and laughter. A perfect evening for friends, couples, or anyone looking to try something new. Materials, drinks, and festive vibes included!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Special Place Collage &ndash; Reimagine a meaningful place through texture, colour and ink transfer<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 11th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on exploring memory and place through collage. You&rsquo;re invited to bring a picture of a special place - somewhere that holds meaning for you - and use it as inspiration to create your own mixed-media artwork. We&rsquo;ll experiment with a range of materials and simple techniques, including ink transfer tracing, to layer texture, colour and imagery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gift your artwork to someone who shares your connection to that special place - or keep it as a gift to yourself as a beautiful reminder of what it means to you.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Painting the Tree of Life &ndash; A Symbol of Growth and Connection<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 18th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for a mindful evening of creativity and reflection as we paint a beautiful cast of the Tree of Life. Using metallic and seasonal tones, you&rsquo;ll design and decorate your own tree. A meaningful artwork to take home or gift for Christmas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Create, sip, and celebrate Christmas at Lumiere Cinema!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Pricing and Tickets:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>1 person for &pound;25 \\/&nbsp;2 people for &pound;45<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please book tickets here:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-\\\">https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889614ART_DRINKS_2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889613ART_DRINKS.webp\",\"url_key\":\"festive-art-drink-film\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"4h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8986\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"VU5lcktEK2xzSGF1VHVvWldPS01adz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1764266400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-11-27 06:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-11 19:53:47\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-27\"},{\"movie_id\":\"432\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-18\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Performing Arts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Olivier Award-winner Jack Lowden (Slow Horses, Dunkirk) is joined by Emmy and BAFTA-winner Martin Freeman (The Hobbit, Sherlock, The Office) starring in the critically acclaimed and subversively funny new play by David Ireland. <br \\/> <br \\/>After years in the 12-step programme of Alcoholics Anonymous, James becomes a sponsor to newcomer Luka. The pair bond over black coffee, trade stories and build a fragile friendship out of their shared experiences. But as Luka approaches step five &ndash; the moment of confession &ndash; dangerous truths emerge, threatening the trust on which both of their recoveries depend. <br \\/> <br \\/>Finn den Hertog directs the provocative and entertaining production filmed live from @sohoplace on London&rsquo;s West End.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>We have added a Special Preview on 18th November, ahead of main shows on 27th and 29th November.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1755042815NTL_2025_The_Fifth_Step_Listing_Images_Portrait874x1240px.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1760225134NTL_2025_The_Fifth_Step_Listing_Images_Landscape_1240x874px.webp\",\"url_key\":\"nt-live-the-fifth-step\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=WLV4Ho-eCTo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"WLV4Ho-eCTo\",\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_yea