e provocative and entertaining production filmed live from @sohoplace on London&rsquo;s West End.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>We have added a Special Preview on 18th November, ahead of main shows on 27th and 29th November.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1755042815NTL_2025_The_Fifth_Step_Listing_Images_Portrait874x1240px.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1760225134NTL_2025_The_Fifth_Step_Listing_Images_Landscape_1240x874px.webp\",\"url_key\":\"nt-live-the-fifth-step\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-29\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=WLV4Ho-eCTo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"WLV4Ho-eCTo\",\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jack Lowden\"},{\"actor\":\"Martin Freeman\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Finn den Hertog\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"69\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live\",\"short_name\":\"nt-live\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"4850\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"anVxVjZ0UDJ2TGd2ODNKNzZpcHMyZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_