 known as &ldquo;Vulture Squad&rdquo; is sent to an isolated jungle valley to uncover the fate of a missing Green Beret platoon. As they hunt through the primordial depths of the valley, they discover ancient horrors that not only threaten to unravel their minds, but to end their lives as well. Dinosaurs have somehow been unleashed&hellip;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>When the casualties mount, the members of &ldquo;Vulture Squad&rdquo; must abandon their human nature and give in to their savage instincts in order to survive.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong bloody violence, gore, language, drug misuse, brief nudity.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763071505PRIMITIVE-WAR_ONE_SHEET_Nov_28.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763071590Primitive_War_UK_Landscape_Artwork_Theatrical_CTA_Signature_Entertainment.webp\",\"url_key\":\"primitive-war\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-29\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=zDRI8KlNGoY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"zDRI8KlNGoY\",\"duration\":\"2h 33m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ryan Kwanten\"},{\"actor\":\"Jeremy Piven\"},{\"actor\":\"Tricia Helfer\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Luke Sparke\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"th