-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-11-30\"},{\"movie_id\":\"722\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"},{\"name\":\"Musical\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The spellbinding finale to the global phenomenon.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring the spectacular returning cast, led by Academy Award&reg; nominated superstars Cynthia Erivo and Ariana Grande, the final chapter of the untold story of the witches of Oz begins with Elphaba and Glinda estranged and living with the consequences of their choices. While Elphaba, now demonised as The Wicked Witch, lives in exile and fights for truth from the shadows, Glinda revels in the perks of fame and popularity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Torn apart by power, destiny, and heartbreak, their once-unbreakable friendship becomes the key to saving Oz when darkness rises.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mild threat, violence, innuendo, language<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wickedforgood.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wicked.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wicked-for-good\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-11-30\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"duration\":\"2h 37m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Cynthia Erivo\"},{\"actor\":\"Ariana Grande\"},{\"actor\":\"Jeff Goldblum\"},{\"actor\":\"Michelle Yeoh\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jon M. Chu\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert17415