uth from the shadows, Glinda revels in the perks of fame and popularity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Torn apart by power, destiny, and heartbreak, their once-unbreakable friendship becomes the key to saving Oz when darkness rises.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mild threat, violence, innuendo, language<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wickedforgood.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wicked.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wicked-for-good\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"duration\":\"2h 37m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Cynthia Erivo\"},{\"actor\":\"Ariana Grande\"},{\"actor\":\"Jeff Goldblum\"},{\"actor\":\"Michelle Yeoh\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jon M. Chu\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8422\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"NXgyLzgvTDJMdmU2UWlGa0V4a2NlQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 1\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-0