bbish Wall Street commodities broker and a wily street hustler find their positions reversed as part of a bet by two callous millionaire brothers who run a brokerage house.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/937lqY5ChIwxRWpgSFEXgSvwmN4.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/klwOBIaFdXfzuNQnJDJBOCqbgV2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"trading-places-1983\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.5\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=vEaXAsbvHV4\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"vEaXAsbvHV4\",\"duration\":\"1h 56m\",\"movie_year\":\"1983\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Eddie Murphy\"},{\"actor\":\"Dan Aykroyd\"},{\"actor\":\"Ralph Bellamy\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"John Landis\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8612\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Z3BQVXZWeE9VdG80ZzQrTUtrcUhXUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-02\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:10pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.10\",\"time_sorting\":1764699000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-02 06:10pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-03 21:29:47\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-02\"},{\"movie_id\":\"365\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Kaleidoscope's Monthly Mystery LGBTQ+ Film\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-08-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Lumiere and Kaleidoscope are working together to bring you monthly mystery LGBTQ+ films!&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Keep an eye on both our respective social channels, 'cos you might find some clues! ;)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>October's clue:<\\/strong> If it's in a word or it's in a look... you can't get rid of him!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>November's clue:<\\/strong> She's on fire, and so is this film!&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>December's clue:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Manhattan at Christmas never looked so good!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>Please note these monthly screenings are available for anyone above the age of the film's certificate indicated on the left hand side of this page, not just for 17-24 year olds.&nbsp;<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>More about Kaleidoscope<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Kaleidoscope is a monthly LGBTQ+ social group for 17-24 year olds. It was set up in 2022 when local members were tired of not having a flourishing LGBTQ+ scene in Romford, and feeling like support and advice wasn&rsquo;t available when they needed it.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.kaleidoscoperomford.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">the Kaleidoscope Romford website here for more details.<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1753134906Lumiere_Portrait_Website_1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1757438615LGBTQ_Film_poster_generic.webp\",\"url_key\":\"mystery-lgbtq\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"59\",\"name\":\"Kaleidoscope LGBTQ+\",\"short_name\":\"kaleidosco\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"5121\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"WHJBc01Bb254bjlFQVhrOWRvelE1QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-02\",\"show_time_slots\":\"7:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"19.30\",\"time_sorting\":1764703800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\"