            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"751\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Mr. Krueger's Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-10-19\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Lonely, aging widower Willy Krueger lives in a basement apartment with his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as custodian of the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree; on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carolers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him, offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the caroling group. Handling figures of the small Nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762826335MV5BOTc0YzcwYTktMWE0ZC00NDljLThk.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1760904786mr-kruegers-christmas-screenshot.webp\",\"url_key\":\"krueger\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"0h 26m\",\"movie_year\":\"1980\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"James Stewart\"},{\"actor\":\"Beverly Rowland\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Kieth Merril\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7929\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"KzRDSjRVOEhZLzl0Yjl5bVFRMWx5QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"20\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765015200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-06 10:00am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 21:15:19\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-06\"},{\"movie_id\":\"722\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"},{\"name\":\"Musical\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The spellbinding finale to the global phenomenon.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring the spectacular returning cast, led by Academy Award&reg; nominated superstars Cynthia Erivo and Ariana Grande, the final chapter of the untold story of the witches of Oz begins with Elphaba and Glinda estranged and living with the consequences of their choices. While Elphaba, now demonised as The Wicked Witch, lives in exile and fights for truth from the shadows, Glinda revels in the perks of fame and popularity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Torn apart by power, destiny, and heartbreak, their once-unbreakable friendship becomes the key to saving Oz when darkness rises.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Mild threat, violence, innuendo, language<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wickedforgood.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761869767wicked.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wicked-for-good\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"a1l5pm5YHQ8\",\"duration\":\"2h 37m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Cynthia Erivo\"},{\"actor\":\"Ariana Grande\"},{\"actor\":\"Jeff Goldblum\"},{\"actor\":\"Michelle Yeoh\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jon M. Chu\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9394\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"YU82aWlpQWcxSUs1Q051T3VFcUFnQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 1\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:15am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.15\",\"time_sorting\":1765016100,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-06 10:15am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-24 01:19:16\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"},{\"show_time_id\":\"9393\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"NnhXK2xFS0VhaVRSQUF0eUlsdDF5dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 1\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"1:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"13.15\",\"time_sorting\":1765026900,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-06 01:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-24 01:19:07\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-06\"},{\"movie_id\":\"750\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Nightmare Before Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"1993-10-29\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Jack Skellington, king of Halloween Town, discovers Christmas Town, but his attempts to bring Christmas to his home causes confusion.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/70ftUzJtCUjUbmMJcvNAxHcRQlS.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/pCeJNgmcrdH2RjVquJZmsHh6nns.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-nightmare-before-christmas-1993\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.9\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=8qrB9I3DM80\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"8qrB9I3DM80\",\"duration\":\"1h 16m\",\"movie_year\":\"1993\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Danny Elfman\"},{\"actor\":\"Chris Sarandon\"},{\"actor\":\"Catherine O'Hara\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Henry Selick\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7921\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"b1d6UmM3TTZabUoreER2cGVDenBPZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:50am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.50\",\"time_sorting\":1765018200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-06 10:50am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 12:30:05\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-06\"},{\"movie_id\":\"512\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"World Wide Weird - at Lumiere\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><em><strong>World Wide Weird is proud to present a day of cult cinema with screenings of Macabre (1980), Hell of the Living Dead (1980) and Sayara (2024), featuring special guests (Director) Lamberto Bava, (Actor) Margie Newton and (Director) Can Evrenol.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Each guest will be doing a post-screening Q&A covering the films and their careers, and meeting fans offering table selfies and autographs for a fee:&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Autograph and Selfie fees<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Lamberto Bava, &pound;30<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Margie Newton, &pound;30<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Can Evrenol, &pound;20<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Guests will sign items brought to their table, and will additionally have a limited quantity of their own individually priced merch and photos for sale.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Limited numbers of signed 'Cannibal Worlds' published by Pulse Books will be available for sale, price TBC.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Schedule of the day<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>11.30am - Screening of&nbsp;HELL OF THE LIVING DEAD.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>1.30pm - Q&A with actor Margie Newton.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>2.30pm - Q&A with author Eugenio Ercolani, UK Launch of Cannibal Worlds.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>4.00pm - Screening of MACABRE.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>5.30pm - Q&A with director Lamberto Bava.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>7.30pm - Screening of SAYARA.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>9.10pm - Q&A with director Can Evrenol.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book tickets, head to:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.tickettailor.com\\/events\\/worldwideweird\\/1848794\\\">https:\\/\\/www.tickettailor.com\\/events\\/worldwideweird\\/1848794<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Tickets must be presented at the Lumiere box office on the day to receive a wristband, which must be shown to enter screening and Q&As.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1757434209portrait_WWW_POSTER_A3_Hi_Res.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1757434736FINAL_WWW_POSTER_A3_Hi_Res.webp\",\"url_key\":\"worldwideweirdlumiere\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"78\",\"name\":\"Lamberto Bava Season\",\"short_name\":\"Bava\",\"description\":\"A selection of movies celebrating the Italian horror director\\/producer. \"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tickettailor.com\\/events\\/worldwideweird\\/1848794\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"5881\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"eTI2ZlFMV0UyOUd1d0dZZ05RM2c3dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"11:00am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"11.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765018800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-06 11:00am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-09-09 17:17:13\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tickettailor.com\\/events\\/worldwideweird\\/1848794\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-06\"},{\"movie_id\":\"749\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2011-11-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Comedy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Santa's clumsy son Arthur sets out on a mission with Grandsanta to give out a misplaced present to a young girl in less than two hours on Christmas Day.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/yF7SNheAGWavNnjbAronedwjC1N.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.webp\",\"url_key\":\"arthur-christmas-2011\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.1\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=vxcz1XIKUmo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"vxcz1XIKUmo\",\"duration\":\"1h 37m\",\"movie_year\":\"2011\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"James McAvoy\"},{\"actor\":\"Jim Broadbent\"},{\"actor\":\"Bill Nighy\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Sarah Smith\"},{\"name\":\"Barry Cook\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7922\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"TkFyWmo2eTY2SFpncUdRRGUzVmhlQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\"