\r\\n<p>But while Christy flaunts a fiery persona in the ring, her toughest battles unfold outside it.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Domestic violence or abuse and graphic violence or injury<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763517724Christy_DOM_Online_Teaser_1-Sheet_Punch_FIN_2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/d4uk5cPXuDaxi5ozUys50Wiroax.webp\",\"url_key\":\"christy-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=hSHwFDPfeV8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"hSHwFDPfeV8\",\"duration\":\"2h 35m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sydney Sweeney\"},{\"actor\":\"Ben Foster\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Mich\\u00f4d\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9193\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"VWJMOXhBSTRDcU1idkJrVW0yRnp2UT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 3\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-09\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:25pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.25\",\"time_sorting\":1765283100,\"sold_out\":false