rst love (Callum Turner), who died young and has waited decades for her to arrive.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong sex, nudity<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iKaM4OfSf5ABkFZCo4vU4Dth7ZU.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/tQscGgR0PKIteMoMMwL8ISfRUCH.webp\",\"url_key\":\"eternity-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=irXTps1REHU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"irXTps1REHU\",\"duration\":\"2h 14m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Elizabeth Olsen\"},{\"actor\":\"Miles Teller\"},{\"actor\":\"Callum Turner\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Freyne\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9210\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dW5CeWNKWEJWZUJhZitUeEwwdC9WZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 3\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-09\",\"show_time_slots\":\"3:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"15.15\",\"time_sorting\":1765293300,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_l