<p>Anyone can survive five nights. This time, there will be no second chances.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Five Nights at Freddy&rsquo;s, the highest-grossing horror film of 2023, begins a blood-chilling new chapter of animatronic terror.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>One year has passed since the supernatural nightmare at Freddy Fazbear&rsquo;s Pizza. Former security guard Mike (Josh Hutcherson) and police officer Vanessa (Elizabeth Lail) have kept the truth from Mike&rsquo;s 11-year-old sister, Abby (Piper Rubio), concerning the fate of her animatronic friends. But when Abby sneaks out to reconnect with Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, and Foxy, it will set into motion a terrifying series of events, revealing dark secrets about the true origin of Freddy&rsquo;s, and unleashing a long-forgotten horror hidden away for decades.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/brJkq22WjpLnCuYEEId89FC3NXZ.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/rBjsoUKM0FDuAzYkRW3hd6UtHiq.webp\",\"url_key\":\"five-nights-at-freddys2\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=dSDpoobO6yM\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"dSDpoobO6yM\",\"duration\":\"2h 4m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Josh Hutcherson\"},{\"actor\":\"Elizabeth Lail\"},{\"actor\":\"Piper Rubio\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Emma Tammi\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtim