gin of Freddy&rsquo;s, and unleashing a long-forgotten horror hidden away for decades.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/brJkq22WjpLnCuYEEId89FC3NXZ.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/rBjsoUKM0FDuAzYkRW3hd6UtHiq.webp\",\"url_key\":\"five-nights-at-freddys2\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=dSDpoobO6yM\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"dSDpoobO6yM\",\"duration\":\"2h 4m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Josh Hutcherson\"},{\"actor\":\"Elizabeth Lail\"},{\"actor\":\"Piper Rubio\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Emma Tammi\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9384\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Q3hoOEkwNTA0eS9uVWtQSTRuYkJNZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 2\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"show_time_slots\":\"4:10pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"16.10\",\"time_sorting\":1765469400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_onl