ined life beyond her small-town roots in West Virginia&mdash;until she discovered a knack for punching people. Fueled by grit, raw determination, and an unshakable desire to win, she charges into the world of boxing under the guidance of her trainer and manager-turned-husband, Jim (Ben Foster).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>But while Christy flaunts a fiery persona in the ring, her toughest battles unfold outside it.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Domestic violence or abuse and graphic violence or injury<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763517724Christy_DOM_Online_Teaser_1-Sheet_Punch_FIN_2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/d4uk5cPXuDaxi5ozUys50Wiroax.webp\",\"url_key\":\"christy-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=hSHwFDPfeV8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"hSHwFDPfeV8\",\"duration\":\"2h 35m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sydney Sweeney\"},{\"actor\":\"Ben Foster\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Mich\\u00f4d\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9195\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Kzk2ZE43c2NlN0xjRUhGYnZBVzdQUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"show_time_slots\":\"5:20pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"17.20\",\"time_sorting\":1765473600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-11 05:20pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 02:14:38\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-11\"},{\"movie_id\":\"844\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Art Class + Drink + Film: Festive Edition\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Art + Drinks: Festive Edition at Lumiere Cinema<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get festive with a cosy series of creative Christmas evenings at Lumiere Cinema! Each session includes a fun art workshop, a seasonal drink (prosecco, beer, or mocktail) and a screening of a mystery Christmas film.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Led by local artists from <em>Well Social CIC<\\/em>, every workshop is different, from printing, mindful painting, to portraits and expression. Come with friends, family, or solo and enjoy a relaxed, creative evening.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your ticket includes all materials, a festive beverage, and entry to the film. Perfect for getting into the holiday spirit and making something special to take home!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Upcoming workshops include:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Gelli Plate Printing &ndash; Create Your Own Christmas Cards<\\/strong> <br \\/> <em>Thursday 27th November 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on and discover the magic of Gelli plate printing in this festive art workshop! You&rsquo;ll learn how to create beautiful, layered prints using vibrant inks, stencils, and textures - perfect for turning into your own unique Christmas cards or gift tags. No experience needed - just a love of colour, creativity, and Christmas spirit. All materials provided, and you&rsquo;ll leave with a bundle of handmade cards ready to send to family and friends.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Portrait Painting &ndash; Paint Each Other or Bring a Photo<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 4th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Unleash your inner artist in this relaxed portrait painting session, where you can paint each other or bring a photo of someone special to capture in your own unique style. Guided by an artist, you&rsquo;ll explore colour, expression, and technique in a fun, social setting - no pressure, just creativity and laughter. A perfect evening for friends, couples, or anyone looking to try something new. Materials, drinks, and festive vibes included!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Special Place Collage &ndash; Reimagine a meaningful place through texture, colour and ink transfer<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 11th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on exploring memory and place through collage. You&rsquo;re invited to bring a picture of a special place - somewhere that holds meaning for you - and use it as inspiration to create your own mixed-media artwork. We&rsquo;ll experiment with a range of materials and simple techniques, including ink transfer tracing, to layer texture, colour and imagery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gift your artwork to someone who shares your connection to that special place - or keep it as a gift to yourself as a beautiful reminder of what it means to you.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Painting the Tree of Life &ndash; A Symbol of Growth and Connection<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 18th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for a mindful evening of creativity and reflection as we paint a beautiful cast of the Tree of Life. Using metallic and seasonal tones, you&rsquo;ll design and decorate your own tree. A meaningful artwork to take home or gift for Christmas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Create, sip, and celebrate Christmas at Lumiere Cinema!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Pricing and Tickets:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>1 person for &pound;25 \\/&nbsp;2 people for &pound;45<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please book tickets here:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-\\\">https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889614ART_DRINKS_2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889613ART_DRINKS.webp\",\"url_key\":\"festive-art-drink-film\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"4h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8988\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Mmx6cVQ4N3VndFNXS09kRmorNjhBQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765476000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-11 06:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-11 20:05:30\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-11\"},{\"movie_id\":\"751\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Mr. Krueger's Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-10-19\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Lonely, aging widower Willy Krueger lives in a basement apartment with his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as custodian of the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree; on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carolers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him, offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the caroling group. Handling figures of the small Nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762826335MV5BOTc0YzcwYTktMWE0ZC00NDljLThk.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1760904786mr-kruegers-christmas-screenshot.webp\",\"url_key\":\"krueger\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-11\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"0h 26m\",\"movie_year\":\"1980\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"James Stewart\"},{\"actor\":\"Beverly Rowland\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Kieth Merril\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8639\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Tz