isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-12\"},{\"movie_id\":\"791\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Joyeux Noel\",\"date_release_date\":\"2005-11-09\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"France, Germany, UK, Belgium, Romania, Japan\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Music\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>In December 1914, an unofficial Christmas truce on the Western Front allows soldiers from opposing sides of the First World War to gain insight into each other's way of life.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/9Ka8lKCIiWjnZiMslPQeakS5UhW.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/mG7K2pgSnbWQmuPi7w0rzMwksYZ.webp\",\"url_key\":\"joyeux-noel-2005\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-12\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.6\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=iiZPt80VGgc\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"iiZPt80VGgc\",\"duration\":\"1h 56m\",\"movie_year\":\"2005\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Diane Kruger\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8640\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"ZkZLSHNBLzBtM1BxTFZLcTZNSDNKZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-12\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.15\",\"time_sorting\":1765548900,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-12 02:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-03 22:15:13\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-12\"},{\"movie_id\":\"854\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Preparation for the Next Life\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Based on Atticus Lish&rsquo;s novel of the same name, Preparation for the Next Life follows the story of Aishe, a Uyghur immigrant trained by her military father, who meets Skinner, a young American soldier who has just returned from three tours in the Middle East. In a bustling Chinatown miles away from downtown New York City, the two spark a deep connection. Together, they explore life&rsquo;s greatest meaning and their determination to devise better lives than the ones they have been given.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains strong language, sex.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iG8Mf7U30mwKTr0n7l3r5bTi79f.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\