            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"740\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Miracle on 34th Street\",\"date_release_date\":\"1947-07-04\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>After a divorced New York mother hires a nice old man to play Santa Claus at Macy's, she is startled by his claim to be the genuine article. When his sanity is questioned, a lawyer defends him in court by arguing that he's not mistaken.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/qyAc9X9XHloIqy3oJbbZ44Cw0Hm.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hHYoUYgto562dcQRjVuuVlosBKz.webp\",\"url_key\":\"miracle-on-34th-street-1947\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.9\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=kUwyGo6PQzY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"kUwyGo6PQzY\",\"duration\":\"1h 36m\",\"movie_year\":\"1947\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Edmund Gwenn\"},{\"actor\":\"Maureen O'Hara\"},{\"actor\":\"John Payne\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"George Seaton\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7915\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RDdlc214aGJOSzRCdVVjSHN2OHUzUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765706400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 10:00am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 12:24:39\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"745\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"White Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"1954-11-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Musical\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A successful song-and-dance team become romantically involved with a sister act and team up to save the failing Vermont inn of their former commanding general.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/A5kBQsHKbIptxJyELEpHQJROCRj.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/tXQHzXZSt2ibMYYpGtwHBjVfRbC.webp\",\"url_key\":\"white-christmas-1954\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.5\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=3n3-UtakD3I\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"3n3-UtakD3I\",\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"1954\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Bing Crosby\"},{\"actor\":\"Danny Kaye\"},{\"actor\":\"Rosemary Clooney\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Michael Curtiz\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7916\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"bU9OdHg5cVdPNUsrN09oNlRWaHdlZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765713600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 12:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 12:25:11\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"395\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Royal Ballet: The Nutcracker\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The magician Herr Drosselmeyer needs to save his nephew. Hans-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker; the only way to save him is for the Nutcracker to defeat the Mouse King and find a girl to love and care for him. A flicker of hope comes in the form of the young Clara, whom Drosselmeyer meets at a Christmas party. With some magic, a cosy Christmas gathering turns into a marvellous adventure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Peter Wright&rsquo;s The Nutcracker has enchanted audiences since its 1984 premiere by the Company. Featuring Tchaikovsky&rsquo;s most familiar melodies and brought to life by Julia Trevelyan Oman&rsquo;s exquisite designs, The Nutcracker is sure to be a festive firecracker for all ages.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754094694The_Nutcracker-Poster-Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754094694The_Nutcracker-Poster-Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"royalballet-nutcracker\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"3h 45m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"4182\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"bWt6TUFzekdBaFRyZ01yRk9hL2xoZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765720800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 02:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-08-02 21:56:20\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"739\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"date_release_date\":\"1992-12-11\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA, UK\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The Muppets put their spin on the tale of an elder, Christmas-hating miser who is visited by spirits who foretell his future and share secrets from his past and present, which helps change his view on life.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ssrV29QSVVJuemBHho0Qx7pFYak.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/2WWs8PqWcx34CsvqvVVQahdvUw8.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-muppet-christmas-carol-1992\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.8\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=KAk5KQABLuE\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"KAk5KQABLuE\",\"duration\":\"1h 25m\",\"movie_year\":\"1992\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Michael Caine\"},{\"actor\":\"Dave Goelz\"},{\"actor\":\"Steve Whitmire\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Brian Henson\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7917\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"NGo1cEV3ZGNsWkQ5bGdrdWdJbHBVdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.30\",\"time_sorting\":1765722600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 02:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 12:26:23\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"856\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Silent Sherlock: Three Classic Cases from the BFI National Archive\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-12\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Crime\"},{\"name\":\"Mystery\"},{\"name\":\"Silent\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>\\\"The opportunity to discover the man who set the standard for all screen Sherlocks to come.&rdquo; - Sight and Sound.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For decades, Sherlock Holmes fans worldwide have been waiting for the restoration of The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes series.&nbsp;The series, which was so popular it ran for 45 episodes, was sanctioned by Arthur Conan Doyle, who thoroughly approved of Eille Norwood as Holmes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This programme features a selection of three newly restored episodes: 'A Scandal in Bohemia', wherein Holmes falls for &lsquo;the woman&rsquo;; 'The Golden Pince-Nez', which features Holmes&rsquo; deductive powers at work, and 'The Final Problem', featuring the sinister Professor Moriarty.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The episodes are accompanied by newly commissioned scores by Joanna MacGregor, Neil Brand and Joseph Havlat, recorded live at the Alexandra Palace Theatre.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains mild violence.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763488503silentsherlockp.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763511471Eille_Norwood_SPD-2136247.webp\",\"url_key\":\"silent-sherlock-three-classic-cases-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=V9AkClD-DlY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"V9AkClD-DlY\",\"duration\":\"1h 35m\",\"movie_year\":\"1923\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Eille Norwood\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Maurice Elvey\"},{\"name\":\"George Ridgwell\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9149\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"YldpVWhZdzlScVNUVmVjR1hIblplZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"4:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"16.00\",\"time_sorting\":1765728000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 04:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 00:19:31\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"750\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Nightmare Before Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"1993-10-29\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Jack Skellington, king of Halloween Town, discovers Christmas Town, but his attempts to bring Christmas to his home causes confusion.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/70ftUzJtCUjUbmMJcvNAxHcRQlS.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/pCeJNgmcrdH2RjVquJZmsHh6nns.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-nightmare-before-christmas-1993\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.9\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=8qrB9I3DM80\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"8qrB9I3DM80\",\"duration\":\"1h 16m\",\"movie_year\":\"1993\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Danny Elfman\"},{\"actor\":\"Chris Sarandon\"},{\"actor\":\"Catherine O'Hara\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Henry Selick\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"7918\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"SUZ1WmpVYXQvVU94cUlFMDdUeVd1dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"4:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"16.30\",\"time_sorting\":1765729800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 04:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-19 12:26:43\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"752\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Art + Sound Bath Sundays: Mindful Art Workshop + Restorative Sound Bath\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-02\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"},{\"name\":\"Meditation\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A creative and calming experience to relax and reset.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for<strong>&nbsp;Art&nbsp;+&nbsp;Sound Sunday<\\/strong>&nbsp;&ndash; a nourishing blend of&nbsp;guided mindful art&nbsp;and a&nbsp;deeply relaxing sound bath&nbsp;designed to help you reconnect, express, and restore.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you're looking to explore your creativity, unwind from stress, or simply take a mindful pause, this experience offers a safe, welcoming space to slow down and come home to yourself.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>5pm - 6.30pm Mindful Art Workshop<\\/strong><br \\/>A gentle, meditative art-making session with Lucy using a variety of mediums from print, textile to experimental sculptural and crafting techniques. No art experience required &ndash; all materials provided.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>7pm - 8pm Sound Bath<\\/strong><br \\/>A unique journey of sound in an immersive cinema screen listening to gong, crystal & tibetan bowls, chimes, and other healing instruments to help calm the nervous system and to help you reset.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Booking Options<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Art Workshop only&nbsp;&ndash; &pound;20 each or 2 people for &pound;30<br \\/>Sound Bath only&nbsp;&ndash; &pound;20 each or 2 people for &pound;30<br \\/>Both sessions (save with bundle)&nbsp;&ndash; &pound;35<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>What to Bring<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable clothing<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Yoga mat, blanket, cushion (for sound bath portion)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This experience is open to all levels &mdash; no previous art or meditation experience is needed. Just bring an open heart and a willingness to slow down. Book into ONE or BOTH<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-sound-sundays-at-lumiere-cinema-tickets-1815600523039\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here to book your tickets now!<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Bluerskies Mindful Creatives, FB\\/INSTA: @bluerskiescreatives<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761001687ArtSoundSundayInstagram_Post.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1761000624SOUND_BATH_900_x_600_px.webp\",\"url_key\":\"art-and-sound-bath-sundays\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"3h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_cert