, Luxembourg, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Crime\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>When an auto mechanic encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal&rsquo;s identity is the squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Winner of Cannes Film Festival 2025.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains infrequent strong language, moderate violence.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/rTR6bDRyNAcFGlmf1PGx7sH2XhF.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/xbD4brQDBMPhh3Xv459m4XmVJG.webp\",\"url_key\":\"it-was-just-an-accident-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=9oHw2ubyWE4\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"9oHw2ubyWE4\",\"duration\":\"2h 5m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Vahid Mobasseri\"},{\"actor\":\"Mariam Afshari\"},{\"actor\":\"Ebrahim Azizi\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jafar Panahi\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9290\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"ZXgwU3BFMWpHaFJ5WDd1YkptRXFTZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"