,\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Shining: 45th Anniversary\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-12\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Stanley Kubrick&rsquo;s The Shining is a landmark of psychological horror, adapted from Stephen King&rsquo;s novel. Jack Nicholson delivers an iconic performance as Jack Torrance, a writer who takes his family to the isolated Overlook Hotel, where sinister forces push him toward madness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With unforgettable imagery, an eerie score, and a slow-burning sense of dread, The Shining has become one of the most influential horror films of all time, leaving an indelible mark on cinema and pop culture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong violence, language<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hljO0M5K6pmKZo9FPSi7g5Cck6B.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/kVQAg7XdVXLECPXP805NaMDDoHy.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-shining-anniversary\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"8.4\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=FZQvIJxG9Xs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"FZQvIJxG9Xs\",\"duration\":\"2h 44m\",\"movie_year\":\"1980\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jack Nicholson\"},{\"actor\":\"Shelley Duvall\"},{\"actor\":\"Danny Lloyd\"},{\"actor\":\"Scatman Crothers\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Stanley Kubrick\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"65\",\"name\":\"Anniversary re-release\",\"short_name\":\"anniversar\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9056\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"cGlaQ3dkdU5DbnVXUHFweG9MNEZ6QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"8:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"20.15\",\"time_sorting\":1765743300,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 08:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-12 02:50:04\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"854\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Preparation for the Next Life\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Based on Atticus Lish&rsquo;s novel of the same name, Preparation for the Next Life follows the story of Aishe, a Uyghur immigrant trained by her military father, who meets Skinner, a young American soldier who has just returned from three tours in the Middle East. In a bustling Chinatown miles away from downtown New York City, the two spark a deep connection. Together, they explore life&rsquo;s greatest meaning and their determination to devise better lives than the ones they have been given.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains strong language, sex.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iG8Mf7U30mwKTr0n7l3r5bTi79f.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iOuNtoSIg4AItzzB9pmFnlMLc27.webp\",\"url_key\":\"preparation-for-the-next-life\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=dmQA8cO0lIc\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"dmQA8cO0lIc\",\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sebiye Behtiyar\"},{\"actor\":\"Fred Hechinger\"},{\"actor\":\"Alicher Adill\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Bing Liu\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9283\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"OWNCd1crZG1yVzhHdEdPVTRRMGVNUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"8:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"20.30\",\"time_sorting\":1765744200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-14 08:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 17:42:49\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"751\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Mr. Krueger's Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-10-19\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Lonely, aging widower Willy Krueger lives in a basement apartment with his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as custodian of the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree; on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carolers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him, offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the caroling group. Handling figures of the small Nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762826335MV5BOTc0