            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"764\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Bell, Book and Candle\",\"date_release_date\":\"1958-12-19\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A modern-day witch likes her neighbor but despises his fianc&eacute;e, so she enchants him to love her instead.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/parkcircus.com\\/latest\\/P2866-Christina-Newland-Presents-#3:-Bell,-Book-and-Candle\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">New programme notes for this film written by writer and critic Christina Newland can be found here.<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/7ijQjzfbD0Qe2AQxlxjeeciYKjD.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/y5e5MTZtbMesmJ7EYgBdlceMcWq.webp\",\"url_key\":\"bell-book-and-candle-1958\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.8\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=nDBbmP2TctE\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"nDBbmP2TctE\",\"duration\":\"1h 46m\",\"movie_year\":\"1958\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"James Stewart\"},{\"actor\":\"Kim Novak\"},{\"actor\":\"Jack Lemmon\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Richard Quine\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8446\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dktxQ3VGcGp1V29rYUI0L1YvTjBydz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00am\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1766052000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-18 10:00am\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-10-31 17:24:03\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"847\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Shining: 45th Anniversary\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-12\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Stanley Kubrick&rsquo;s The Shining is a landmark of psychological horror, adapted from Stephen King&rsquo;s novel. Jack Nicholson delivers an iconic performance as Jack Torrance, a writer who takes his family to the isolated Overlook Hotel, where sinister forces push him toward madness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With unforgettable imagery, an eerie score, and a slow-burning sense of dread, The Shining has become one of the most influential horror films of all time, leaving an indelible mark on cinema and pop culture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong violence, language<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hljO0M5K6pmKZo9FPSi7g5Cck6B.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/kVQAg7XdVXLECPXP805NaMDDoHy.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-shining-anniversary\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"8.4\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=FZQvIJxG9Xs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"FZQvIJxG9Xs\",\"duration\":\"2h 44m\",\"movie_year\":\"1980\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jack Nicholson\"},{\"actor\":\"Shelley Duvall\"},{\"actor\":\"Danny Lloyd\"},{\"actor\":\"Scatman Crothers\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Stanley Kubrick\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"65\",\"name\":\"Anniversary re-release\",\"short_name\":\"anniversar\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9053\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"aWo3RWFhbEhXOXMrZnVsb09DZENtUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:40pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.40\",\"time_sorting\":1766061600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-18 12:40pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-12 02:32:50\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"757\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"How the Grinch Stole Christmas\",\"date_release_date\":\"2000-11-17\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"Germany, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>On the outskirts of Whoville lives a green, revenge-seeking Grinch who plans to ruin Christmas for all of the citizens of the town.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1WZbbPApEivA421gCOluuzMMKCk.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/lOGEIlb9Yz1DgNJOdI64PGBBKnL.webp\",\"url_key\":\"how-the-grinch-stole-christmas-2000\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.4\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=myTaigPrbsg\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"myTaigPrbsg\",\"duration\":\"1h 44m\",\"movie_year\":\"2000\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jim Carrey\"},{\"actor\":\"Taylor Momsen\"},{\"actor\":\"Kelley\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Ron Howard\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"83\",\"name\":\"Greatest Christmas Movies\",\"short_name\":\"XMAS\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8509\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"cnpGQTVDTWRSNHFlWkF5c0FNSlJkZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.00\",\"time_sorting\":1766066400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-18 02:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-01 20:43:44\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"844\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Art Class + Drink + Film: Festive Edition\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-11-27\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Art + Drinks: Festive Edition at Lumiere Cinema<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get festive with a cosy series of creative Christmas evenings at Lumiere Cinema! Each session includes a fun art workshop, a seasonal drink (prosecco, beer, or mocktail) and a screening of a mystery Christmas film.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Led by local artists from <em>Well Social CIC<\\/em>, every workshop is different, from printing, mindful painting, to portraits and expression. Come with friends, family, or solo and enjoy a relaxed, creative evening.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your ticket includes all materials, a festive beverage, and entry to the film. Perfect for getting into the holiday spirit and making something special to take home!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Upcoming workshops include:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Gelli Plate Printing &ndash; Create Your Own Christmas Cards<\\/strong> <br \\/> <em>Thursday 27th November 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on and discover the magic of Gelli plate printing in this festive art workshop! You&rsquo;ll learn how to create beautiful, layered prints using vibrant inks, stencils, and textures - perfect for turning into your own unique Christmas cards or gift tags. No experience needed - just a love of colour, creativity, and Christmas spirit. All materials provided, and you&rsquo;ll leave with a bundle of handmade cards ready to send to family and friends.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Portrait Painting &ndash; Paint Each Other or Bring a Photo<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 4th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Unleash your inner artist in this relaxed portrait painting session, where you can paint each other or bring a photo of someone special to capture in your own unique style. Guided by an artist, you&rsquo;ll explore colour, expression, and technique in a fun, social setting - no pressure, just creativity and laughter. A perfect evening for friends, couples, or anyone looking to try something new. Materials, drinks, and festive vibes included!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Special Place Collage &ndash; Reimagine a meaningful place through texture, colour and ink transfer<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 11th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get hands-on exploring memory and place through collage. You&rsquo;re invited to bring a picture of a special place - somewhere that holds meaning for you - and use it as inspiration to create your own mixed-media artwork. We&rsquo;ll experiment with a range of materials and simple techniques, including ink transfer tracing, to layer texture, colour and imagery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gift your artwork to someone who shares your connection to that special place - or keep it as a gift to yourself as a beautiful reminder of what it means to you.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Painting the Tree of Life &ndash; A Symbol of Growth and Connection<\\/strong><br \\/><em>Thursday 18th December 6-8pm - film from 8.15pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for a mindful evening of creativity and reflection as we paint a beautiful cast of the Tree of Life. Using metallic and seasonal tones, you&rsquo;ll design and decorate your own tree. A meaningful artwork to take home or gift for Christmas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Create, sip, and celebrate Christmas at Lumiere Cinema!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Pricing and Tickets:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>1 person for &pound;25 \\/&nbsp;2 people for &pound;45<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please book tickets here:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-\\\">https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889614ART_DRINKS_2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1762889613ART_DRINKS.webp\",\"url_key\":\"festive-art-drink-film\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"4h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"8989\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"R3FibUZGTFlkMktoVHpaMGlTZnkzdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1766080800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-18 06:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-11 20:05:47\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/art-drinks-festive-edition-tickets-1963478498043\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"854\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Preparation for the Next Life\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Based on Atticus Lish&rsquo;s novel of the same name, Preparation for the Next Life follows the story of Aishe, a Uyghur immigrant trained by her military father, who meets Skinner, a young American soldier who has just returned from three tours in the Middle East. In a bustling Chinatown miles away from downtown New York City, the two spark a deep connection. Together, they explore life&rsquo;s greatest meaning and their determination to devise better lives than the ones they have been given.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains strong language, sex.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iG8Mf7U30mwKTr0n7l3r5bTi79f.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/iOuNtoSIg4AItzzB9pmFnlMLc27.webp\",\"url_key\":\"preparation-for-the-next-life\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=dmQA8cO0lIc\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"dmQA8cO0lIc\",\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sebiye Behtiyar\"},{\"actor\":\"Fred Hechinger\"},{\"actor\":\"Alicher Adill\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Bing Liu\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9287\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"QkVudUowSkFFRnNDWjdEbW5ldDh1QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1766080800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-18 06:00pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 17:48:51\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"855\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"It Was Just an Accident\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"Iran, France, Luxembourg, USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Crime\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>When an auto mechanic encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal&rsquo;s identity is the squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Winner of Cannes Film Festival 2025.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains infrequent strong language, moderate violence.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/rTR6bDRyNAcFGlmf1PGx7sH2XhF.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/xbD4brQDBMPhh3Xv459m4XmVJG.webp\",\"url_key\":\"it-was-just-an-accident-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=9oHw2ubyWE4\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"9oHw2ubyWE4\",\"duration\":\"2h 5m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Vahid Mobasseri\"},{\"actor\":\"Mariam Afshari\"},{\"actor\":\"Ebrahim Azizi\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jafar Panahi\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"9294\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"NlZLYUdFZnRyVjE4WEFQeXFLcU96dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-18\",\"show_time_slots\":\"8:30pm\",\"show_time_