to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-27 03:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 23:37:03\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"},{\"show_time_id\":\"9351\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"algyTHgwNVAxZjZlUGhkY1JuemxMUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-27\",\"show_time_slots\":\"7:45pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"19.45\",\"time_sorting\":1766864700,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2025-12-27 07:45pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-11-19 23:37:03\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2025-12-27\"},{\"movie_id\":\"850\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-12-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Martial Arts\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Quentin Tarantino&rsquo;s <strong>KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR<\\/strong> unites Volumes 1 and 2 into a single, unrated epic - presented exactly as he intended, <em>complete with a new, never-before-seen anime sequence<\\/em>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Uma Thurman stars as The Bride, left for dead after her former boss and lover Bill ambushes her wedding rehearsal, shooting her in the head and stealing her unborn child. To exact her vengeance, she must first hunt down the four remaining members of the Deadly Viper Assassination Squad before confronting Bill himself.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With its operatic scope, relentless action, and iconic style, <strong>THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR<\\/strong> stands as one of cinema&rsquo;s definitive revenge sagas - rarely shown in its complete form, <em>and now presented with a classic intermission<\\/em>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Very strong, bloody violence. strong language <\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1763420883Kill_bill_4_5.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17634208820079996.webp\",\"url_key\":\"kill-bill-the-whole-bloody-affair-2025\",\"session_start_date\":\"2025-12-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=-SzkFgEqB6Y\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"-SzkFgEqB6Y\",\"duration\":\"5h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2025\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Uma Thurman\"},{\"actor\":\"David Carradine\"},{\"actor\":\"Daryl Hannah\"},{\"actor\":\"Michael Madsen\"},{\"actor\":\"Vivica A. Fox\"},{\"actor\":\"Lucy Liu\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Quentin Tarantino\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_op