          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"388\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"R.E.M. X Buster Keaton's Sherlock Jr: Silents Synced\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-02-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Music\"},{\"name\":\"Silent\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Silents Synced pairs classic silent movies with epic rock music to bring audiences a unique big screen experience. Buster Keaton&rsquo;s 1924 comedy classic is reimagined with R.E.M. 's alt-rock masterpieces Monster (1994) and New Adventures in Hi-Fi (1996). In this sublime comedy teetering between reality and illusion, Buster Keaton stars as a film projectionist who dreams of becoming a detective. He uses his limited skills when he is framed by a rival for stealing his girlfriend&rsquo;s father&rsquo;s pocket watch. Keaton reportedly broke his neck performing one of the many dangerous practical stunts in the film.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>Whether you&rsquo;re a movie lover or a rock music fan this is an experience you won&rsquo;t want to miss!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The screening will begin with a 22 minute Buster Keaton short, <em>The Balloonatic<\\/em> (1923)&nbsp;which has music composed by renowned Brazilian electronic artist, Amon Tobin.&nbsp;This will then be followed by a 3 minute introduction by Josh Frank (creator of Silent Synced), before the R.E.M x Sherlock Jr. feature begins.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754047237r-e-m-x-buster-keatons-sherlock.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754047236SilentsSynced-SherlockJr-Quad-Da.webp\",\"url_key\":\"rem-sherlockjr\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-02-05\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=otwTXYFHmFc\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"otwTXYFHmFc\",\"duration\":\"1h 34m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Buster Keaton\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Buster Keaton\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"62\",\"name\":\"Silents Synced!\",\"short_name\":\"SilentsSyn\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"4852\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"VEdGdzJvenFDakMwRDIzSnRmZ25Bdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-02-05\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:30pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.30\",\"time_sorting\":1770316200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2026-02-05 06:30pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-08-13 01:42:29\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this