          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"393\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Giselle\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-03-03\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The peasant girl Giselle has fallen in love with Albrecht. When she discovers that he is actually a nobleman promised to another, she kills herself in despair. Her spirit joins the Wilis: the vengeful ghosts of women hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death. Wracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle&rsquo;s grave, where he must face the Wilis &ndash; and Giselle&rsquo;s ghost.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Peter Wright&rsquo;s 1985 production of this quintessential Romantic ballet is a classic of The Royal Ballet repertory. Set to Adolphe Adam&rsquo;s evocative score and with atmospheric designs by John Macfarlane, Giselle conjures up the earthly and otherworldly realms in a tale of love, betrayal and redemption.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754093886Giselle-Poster-Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754093886Giselle-Poster-Landscape_1.webp\",\"url_key\":\"royalballet-giselle\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-03-03\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"4h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"4555\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Z2xST3VFRVdTK3JaM0FreDRnQzdsZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-03-03\",\"show_time_slots\":\"7:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"19.15\",\"time_sorting\":1772565300,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2026-03-03 07:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-08-08 00:56:06\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-03-03\"}],\"page_number\":1,\"per_page\":100,\"total_pages\":1},\"x_signature\":\"udjq0FXa3d9\\/fSzh1wOwjIm5SIe3N57D5z1xudR2RdymyBlTLxXpZ38lHO9Y3VrfneK87NfrzOuQOR4tiZzhCExxLDKVISZloKP4kS2+4fBckhNBPIs\\/7kT6FWRA3BiUasniWItpJEqty1ANKuAfN0ITwQwupw4LB3m2M7zXsC9dOuVOOoG7R8WOT3IH4MM+tvN4JCoUHE796FSe4P1LJxXUpevyLrLVMMoiKmETwjN9P+lg2230Her9VHUxeqmlVnTsiOlmYpr71vi+W+U9CYna3CCgS9B+k3Qg45MBtzXAmVGnNbOVqDgwcGdF\\/eoNfiVEZr4tbovVqWy4Li8chQ==\",\"timestamp\":\"1764019884\"}",
