          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"398\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Royal Opera: Siegfried\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-03-31\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Raised by a scheming dwarf and unaware of his true family origins, a young man embarks on an epic journey. Soon, destiny brings him face-to-face with a shattered sword, a fearsome dragon and the cursed ring it guards, and a Valkyrie forced into enchanted slumber...<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Moments of transcendent beauty and heroic triumph sparkle in the third chapter of Wagner&rsquo;s Ring cycle, brought to life under Barrie Kosky&rsquo;s inspired direction following his spectacular productions of Das Rheingold (2023) and Die Walk&uuml;re (2025).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Andreas Schager, in his much-anticipated debut with The Royal Opera, stars as Siegfried&rsquo;s titular hero, alongside Christopher Maltman&rsquo;s towering Wanderer, Peter Hoare&rsquo;s treacherous Mime and Elisabet Strid&rsquo;s radiant Br&uuml;nnhilde. Antonio Pappano conducts, drawing out the unspoken tensions and ethereal mysticism of Wagner&rsquo;s dynamic score.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754095397Siegfried-Web-Thumbail-Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1754095396Siegfried-Web-Thumbail-Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"royalopera-siegfried\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-03-31\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"5h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"4557\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Tmg2RzV2dWUxM3pEbmQveENMZnBwQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-03-31\",\"show_time_slots\":\"5:15pm\",\"show_time_hours\":\"17.15\",\"time_sorting\":1774973700,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"2026-03-31 05:15pm\",\"show_time_created_at\":\"2025-08-08 00:57:46\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-03-31\"}],\"page_number\":1,\"per_page\":100,\"total_pages\":1},\"x_signature\":\"nh7zp8tytjb9UKGFT0P1vrNEj+OJZFL2KMDy7sgvgQ3AF6edEQnaOQxswIl9MFzLzOtPhOY2BntfOIRrZB+GNF0wW0R1hkq74AJMREzeuoKgOT\\/p5V8n7vpkifL0mEZHJz0wAxoIw8TiGGgpMpcZDTfSB1fNHCOvDfUtLld\\/Wq9FdHglAxOyUVio\\/MJSkQecwjguka5IW0oAlhs5EospelGsThsie2LqqujVNlY3VclP3qXYfgMCAuurpgf2qpsh\\/+ofd337ywAID5SS94\\/Oge\\/M7j\\/s\\/umjzMG811GO2\\/3S5igNtNcqX4GqHAZ2pCCuVeefHMPvAaJZYiePZWpCIQ==\",\"timestamp\":\"1764019885\"}",
